{"seq":3,"slug":"in-others","title":"In Others","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/major-works/in-others","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"xenophon-memorabilia","title":"色诺芬《回忆苏格拉底》","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/major-works/in-others/xenophon-memorabilia","wordCount":1751,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"aristophanes-clouds","title":"阿里斯托芬《云》","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/major-works/in-others/aristophanes-clouds","wordCount":1692,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"本章考察柏拉图之外记述苏格拉底的其他重要文献。色诺芬的《回忆苏格拉底》，从务实道德导师的角度，呈现了苏格拉底平实亲切的一面；阿里斯托芬的喜剧《云》，则以讽刺的笔调，折射出当时雅典公众对苏格拉底的成见。这些史料与柏拉图的记述相互参照、相互补充，共同构成了我们认识苏格拉底的依据。\n"}